SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This MIT license covers ONLY the original material authored in this repository:
the wrapper and benchmark scripts under scripts/, the configuration under
configs/, the documentation under docs/, and the result files under results/.

It does NOT cover Grounding DINO. This repository contains no Grounding DINO
source code -- the upstream repository is cloned separately by the user, as the
README describes.

Grounding DINO is copyright its authors (IDEA Research) and is distributed under
the Apache License 2.0:

    https://github.com/IDEA-Research/GroundingDINO

The pretrained checkpoint groundingdino_swint_ogc.pth is likewise an upstream
artifact, released by IDEA Research, and is not redistributed here.

COCO 2017 is provided by the COCO Consortium under its own terms:

    https://cocodataset.org/#termsofuse

Nothing in this repository should be read as a claim of authorship over
Grounding DINO, its checkpoint, or the COCO dataset.
